# ELB & Auto Scaling Best Practices

1. Use Application Load Balancer for web applications.
2. Enable Health Checks.
3. Deploy across multiple Availability Zones.
4. Use Auto Scaling with ELB.
5. Configure CloudWatch alarms.
6. Use Launch Templates instead of Launch Configurations.
7. Enable access logs for ELB.
8. Use HTTPS for secure communication.
9. Set appropriate minimum and maximum instance limits.
10. Regularly test Auto Scaling policies.
